Template: donoff-server/mqtt_user
Type: string
Default: donoff
Description: Broker user of the sockets:
 The donoff sockets connect to the broker with this user and password (the
 ones set in the sockets; the same as on mqtt.lab240.ru for the sockets that
 work there now).

Template: donoff-server/mqtt_password
Type: password
Description: Broker password of this user:
 Leave it empty to keep the current password (or to set it later with
 "donoff-server passwd"). The sockets are refused until the user has a
 password.
